  "_readme": [
    "Made with Zyvo (Home). One entry per template; newest addedAt first decides Latest arrivals and the chip order.",
    "videos: file names in the public showcase bucket, folder community/ (NAME.mp4 + NAME.webp poster). Swap, add or remove names here; a template with no videos is hidden.",
